              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano abhantö bha Gitioni bhaagambëri ibhirëmbëëta bhiabho amagana atatö (300), ÖMÖNENE naakorrë Abhamitiani bhagatanga gösookania abhiene kubhiene guisanchö. Bhano bhaatamërë bhakang'osa kuya Serera hano haakögëëra Bheti-sita, kuhika kömöbhaga go Abheri-mehora hang'i na Tabhati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
