              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhaisiraeri bhi ikiaro ke Nabhutari, Aseri na Manase, bhonsui mbaabhërëkëëyöë, bhakarugia Abhamitiani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gitioni agatöma abhantö honsui gönsë yi ibhikerege bhia Ebhuraimu bharundi iga: “Mötang'araara guisiira Abhamitiani na köbharëbhëërra gö kömeria ibhitabhöka na ömooro go Yorotani kuhika Bheti-bhara.” Köhayö, abhasaacha bhonsui bha Ebhuraimu bhagaacha na kömeria ömooro go Yorotani kuhika Bheti-bhara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhakaimukia ubhunyambu abhatangati bhabhërë Abhamitiani, iga Orebhu na Seebhu. Bhagaitëra Orebhu körötare ro Orebhu, Seebhu nawe bhakamuitëra gökëmëtëro gi ichisabhibhu, bhakurugia Abhamitiani. Bakarentera Gitioni ömötöe go Orebhu na ömötöe Seebhu, ihumbu yö ömooro go Yorotani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.7.25"
            ]
          }
        }
